  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A mystic ember blessing adds a separate 1d6 Fire damage roll to a friendly creature's melee weapon damage against a hostile target. It can refresh each turn and is configured to follow the module's critical-damage handling.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
